  "description": "ERUWEV crystallizes in the triclinic crystal system with space group P -1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C30 H20 F60 La4 O16. From the CIF bond table, La1 (La) has 7 O neighbors; La2 (La) has 6 O neighbors; La3 (La) has 7 O neighbors; La4 (La) has 6 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 5 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.841-4.102 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 99.27-111.85°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C30H16F60La4O16. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 1 H2O (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)), 1 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
